## What can be changed on a rug

Every rug has a customisation level. It says what a client may choose on that rug; everything else stays as the rug is shown. Ready-made colour versions and listed round sizes of a rug can be chosen at every level.

{% for custom_level in shop.metaobjects.customisation_level.values -%}
- Level {{ custom_level.number.value }}, {{ custom_level.name.value }}: {{ custom_level.summary.value | strip_newlines }}
{% endfor %}
Shapes sold online: rectangle{% if settings.rug_shape_round %}; round in any diameter, priced on the area of the circle{% endif %}{% if settings.rug_shape_oval %}; oval, priced on the rectangle it fits in{% endif %}{% if settings.rug_shape_corners %}; rectangle with round corners{% if settings.rug_corners_percent > 0 %}, +{{ settings.rug_corners_percent }}%{% endif %}{% endif %}. Any other shape is made on request. A pile above {{ settings.rug_pile_limit | default: 18 }} mm adds {{ settings.rug_pile_percent | default: 0 }}%. A material sold online adds its own supplement; premium materials are made on request.

## Rugs

{% assign llms_replaced = '|' -%}
{%- assign llms_ids = '|' -%}
{%- paginate collections.all.products by 250 -%}
{% for listed in collections.all.products -%}
{%- liquid
  # A rug that another rug replaces (its "Replaced by" field) gives its place to that rug, listed once.
  # The rug of the list is read under another name: Liquid does not let the variable of a loop be given a new value
  assign rug = listed
  assign replacement = listed.metafields.rug.replaced_by.value

  if replacement
    assign replacement_key = '|' | append: replacement.handle | append: '|'

    if llms_replaced contains replacement_key
      continue
    endif

    assign llms_replaced = llms_replaced | append: replacement_key
    assign rug = replacement
  endif

  if rug.metafields.rug.craft_level.value == blank
    continue
  endif

  assign llms_ids = llms_ids | append: rug.id | append: '|'
-%}
{% render 'llms-rug-line', rug: rug, vat_plus: vat_plus, fx: fx -%}
{% endfor %}
{%- endpaginate -%}
{%- comment -%}
The fully custom rug is not in the lists until it is on sale: it is named here all the same, unless "Tailor your rug",
the area it belongs to, is switched off in the theme settings ("Corvo: areas of the site")
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign full_custom = all_products['tailor-made']

  if settings.area_tailor == false
    assign full_custom = nil
  endif

  assign full_custom_key = '|' | append: full_custom.id | append: '|'
-%}
{%- if full_custom.id != blank and full_custom.metafields.rug.craft_level.value != blank -%}
{%- unless llms_ids contains full_custom_key %}
{% render 'llms-rug-line', rug: full_custom, vat_plus: vat_plus, fx: fx -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endif %}
